---
/**
 * DataHub.astro
 * Central access point for research datasets and replication packages.
 */
---

<section class="data-hub-container" id="data-hub">
  <div class="hub-header">
    <h2>Data Hub & Replication</h2>
    <p>In accordance with Open Science principles, the core datasets used in this study are available for scholarly replication. 
       Please refer to the <a href="https://github.com/AntonEbsen/Demography/blob/main/data/data_dictionary.md" target="_blank">Data Dictionary</a> for variable definitions.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="dataset-grid">
    <div class="dataset-card">
      <div class="card-icon">📊</div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3>Master Panel (1851–1881)</h3>
        <p>The primary longitudinal dataset at the RD level, including TFR, IMR, and industrial indices.</p>
        <div class="metadata">
          <span>Format: CSV</span>
          <span>Size: 4.2 MB</span>
        </div>
        <a href="https://github.com/AntonEbsen/Demography/raw/main/data/processed/master_panel_data.csv" class="download-btn">
          Download CSV
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dataset-card">
      <div class="card-icon">🌍</div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3>Spatial Boundary Files</h3>
        <p>GeoJSON polygons for 19th-century Registration Districts, synchronized with census coding.</p>
        <div class="metadata">
          <span>Format: GeoJSON</span>
          <span>Size: 12.8 MB</span>
        </div>
        <a href="https://github.com/AntonEbsen/Demography/tree/main/data/raw" class="download-btn secondary">
          Browse Assets
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="replication-box">
    <h4>Computational Reproducibility</h4>
    <p>Run the full analysis pipeline in your browser using <strong>Binder</strong>. No installation required.</p>
    <a href="https://mybinder.org/v2/gh/AntonEbsen/Demography/main?filepath=notebooks%2Fexam_project.ipynb" target="_blank" class="binder-link">
      <img src="https://mybinder.org/badge_logo.svg" alt="Launch Binder">
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .data-hub-container {
    margin: 6rem 0;
    padding: 4rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-radius: 24px;
  }

  .hub-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .hub-header h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .hub-header p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .hub-header a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .dataset-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .dataset-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .dataset-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .card-body h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .card-body p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .metadata {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .download-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: black;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .download-btn:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.2);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.3);
  }

  .download-btn.secondary {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: white;
  }

  .replication-box {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.05);
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  .replication-box h4 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .replication-box p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .data-hub-container {
      padding: 2rem;
    }
  }

  /* Print optimization */
  @media print {
    .data-hub-container {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
